OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy start
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain but becoming
OL,7,Fdrier for a time later in the evening.
OL,8,FOvernight remaining cloudy with some
OL,9,Flight rain possible. Fresh to strong
OL,10,Fwinds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCloudy in the morning with
OL,13,Flight rain in Orkney, but heavy
OL,14,Fpersistent rain in Shetland. Rain
OL,15,Fclears to the north leaving bright
OL,16,Fspells and showers for all.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
